{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"In the afternoon I spent a few more hours at the Belvedere and then attended Rossini's Figaro. What a Figaro Lablache is! What a Rosine Mde Fodor is! She is a perfect singer; what beauty, grace, art, freedom, and taste in her singing! And the excellent Lablache, what a bass! And how cheerful and freely comic, with nothing low or vulgar anywhere. When the entire chorus sings together, and the orchestra likewise rushes in fortissimo with all its might, it sounds most certainly as if he were singing solo, and this entirely without strain, without shouting, without a screaming tone. Ambrogi was also very good again as Dr. Bartolo, and then there was a new singer, de Franco. It is a whole hedge, partly of the most excellent, partly of flawless excellence. But what a part we the public take! Three to four actors are applauded each time at their first appearance, then every passage is applauded—or bravo! bravi! is called out, then after each scene they are immoderately applauded, the singer thanks and goes off, but the applauding continues with sustained strength, so that he or she is not merely clapped, but rather clapped out. At the end of the piece, however, no calling out or set phrases take place. So, repeated Party and others, one cannot see the Figaro performed anywhere else in Italy. I read today in a Viennese theater sheet that the most experienced are of one opinion that, according to their longest memory, no such Italian company has been in Vienna for 50 years, and certainly will not come again for the next 50 years. The Party people, after I had argued them into it, naturally did not miss a single performance and were collectively most delighted, even though they disparaged the Rossinian music, which sometimes also makes me bored as music."}}],"created":1795080416,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":392,"prompt_tokens":516,"total_tokens":908,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-MedBYzYPVdzBajZPOCjQSZ9wRl0xx0nn","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":516,"prompt_ms":613.356,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.1886744186046512,"prompt_per_second":841.2732572926653,"predicted_n":392,"predicted_ms":9373.053,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.972002557544755,"predicted_per_second":41.71533010642317}}